  "scenario": "Each row uses a fresh ordinary dedicated server with the original AR 1.4.0-32 / LibVulpes 0.2.8-37 on Retrofit 0.6.2-beta and the legacy Starbridge large dock upgrade. One Forge FakePlayer, no rendered clients. Two walkable decks over the full length, width 7 × height 6. The fixture supplied the hull, machine power, loaded working furnaces, loaded chests along the spine to the stern, and genuine upstream propellant buckets. Both original scan and timed native build used their normal buttons. The fixture held each source chunk loaded, used the original monitoring station above the assembler, and reduced the native build timer to 0.01 for both profiling rounds. Cell checks, inventory serialization, native entity ascension and custody used unmodified production paths.",
